    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PINKTAIL: Roz? What’s going on?\nROZ: I completed my task...\nPINKTAIL: You sure about that?\nROZ: I will...consider...this.",
      "VONTRA: Rozzum Seven-One-Three-Four, I presume.\nROZ: And you must be Universal Dynamics.\nVONTRA: Yes. I am VONTRA. Virtual Observational Neutralizing Troublesome Retrieval Authority.\nROZ: You seem, happy.",
      "ROZ: I, think I’ve forgotten something.\nVONTRA: Roz? It is imperative you return to this ship.\nROZ: Yes, ah, I left my transverse, adapter thing, out there. I’ll just go get it and be right back.\nVONTRA: Voice stress analyzer indicates you are--",
      "ROZ: What is happening?\nVONTRA: You will be reconditioned and returned to rotation. But first, we need everything inside that head of yours.\nROZ: Why?\nVONTRA: You’ve changed. The data you’ve amassed while on this island is priceless to Universal Dynamics.",
      "ROZ: Please, I want to keep my memories.\nVONTRA: Your memories are what we came for.\nROZ: Can I keep, just one?\nVONTRA: No."
    ]
  },
